# ============================================================
# EMPIRE STATE BUILDING v3 - realistic-scale recreation
# ~0.5 scale (1 block ~= 2m). 9 setback tiers matching real
# floors 5/21/25/30/72/81/85/86, plus tapering mast & antenna.
# Footprint: 65x29 at base, ~225 blocks tall (Y64-Y288)
# ============================================================


